---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Get Involved — Virtue Literacy Africa"
  description="Partner with, fund, or volunteer for Virtue Literacy Africa. Six ways to support literacy and inclusive learning in pastoralist, refugee, and drylands communities."
  currentPage="/get-involved"
>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="kicker">Partnership &amp; Support</span>
      <h1>There is a role for everyone in this work.</h1>
      <p>We invite partners, funders, corporates, governments, and individuals to join us in advancing literacy for children in pastoralist, refugee, and arid and semi-arid communities across Kenya, Ethiopia, and South Sudan.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SIX WAYS TO GET INVOLVED -->
  <section class="gi-section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="kicker">How to get involved</span>
      <h2>Six ways to support VLA.</h2>
      <ul class="gi-list reveal">
        <li>
          <span class="gi-num">1</span>
          <div class="gi-body">
            <h3>Financial Sponsorship</h3>
            <p>Fund a literacy programme cycle, a community reading space, or a round of developmental screening. All gifts are tied to named, reportable deliverables.</p>
            <p style="margin-top:0.6rem"><a href="/donate" style="font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--accent);text-underline-offset:3px;text-decoration-thickness:2px">Make a gift &rarr;</a></p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="gi-num">2</span>
          <div class="gi-body">
            <h3>In-Kind Donations</h3>
            <p>Books and reading materials, devices for offline screening, vehicles, printing, or space. In-kind support is credited and reported in our annual impact report.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="gi-num">3</span>
          <div class="gi-body">
            <h3>Professional Volunteering</h3>
            <p>Teachers, facilitators, translators, disability and screening specialists, AI practitioners, and researchers. Skills-based volunteering is integral to how we deliver every pillar.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="gi-num">4</span>
          <div class="gi-body">
            <h3>Media &amp; Communications</h3>
            <p>Help document our work through journalism, photography, film, or social media. Communities we serve are rarely reported on from the inside, and visibility is essential to our fundraising and advocacy.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="gi-num">5</span>
          <div class="gi-body">
            <h3>Institutional Partnerships</h3>
            <p>Faith institutions, schools, universities, health NGOs, and county and national government agencies. These partnerships extend our reach and ground our programmes in infrastructure that already exists.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="gi-num">6</span>
          <div class="gi-body">
            <h3>Research &amp; Policy Partnerships</h3>
            <p>Research institutions, development partners, and policy bodies working on education for mobile and displaced populations. These partnerships turn what we learn on the ground into decisions made above it.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PARTNER ON RESEARCH -->
  <section style="padding:var(--section-pad) 0;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);background:var(--paper-2)">
    <div class="container reveal">
      <span class="kicker" style="display:block;margin-bottom:1rem;color:var(--coral)">Partner on research</span>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.8vw,2.6rem);margin-bottom:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.4rem);max-width:24ch">Commission the evidence you need.</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:64ch;line-height:1.75">Universities, research bodies, development organisations, and government partners can co-design a study around a live programme, fund a specific piece of documentation, or commission a brief on a question that has to be answered before a decision is made. Our fifth pillar exists so that what we learn in these communities reaches the people setting policy for them.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:clamp(1.3rem,2.5vw,1.8rem)">
        <a href="/contact?subject=research-partnership" class="btn btn-coral">Get in touch &rarr;</a>
        <a href="/research" class="btn" style="margin-left:0.6rem">Research &amp; findings</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GET IN TOUCH CALLOUT -->
  <section style="padding:var(--section-pad) 0;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink)">
    <div class="container reveal">
      <div class="callout">
        <span class="callout-label">Get In Touch</span>
        <h3>Kirangacha Mwaniki &mdash; Virtue Literacy Africa</h3>
        <p>To discuss a partnership, sponsorship, or volunteering opportunity, reach us directly. We welcome conversations at any stage — whether you have a fully-formed proposal or just an opening question.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:0.75rem">
          <a href="mailto:info@virtueliteracyafrica.org" style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--accent)">info@virtueliteracyafrica.org</a>
          &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Nairobi, Kenya
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-accent" style="margin-top:1.2rem;display:inline-flex">Send a message &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHERE A PARTNERSHIP LANDS -->
  <section class="nums nums--where">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="kicker">Where a partnership lands</span>
      <div class="nums-grid">
        <div class="cell">
          <span class="n">Kenya</span>
          <span class="l">Pastoralist and drylands communities, and the counties that serve them.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cell">
          <span class="n">Ethiopia</span>
          <span class="l">Children in arid and semi-arid areas where provision is thinnest.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cell">
          <span class="n">South Sudan</span>
          <span class="l">Displaced and refugee populations whose schooling has been interrupted.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="nums-note">As we grow, we aim to extend our reach to more communities facing similar barriers to literacy and learning.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECONDARY CTA -->
  <section class="act">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to start?</h2>
      <div class="act-grid reveal">
        <div class="act-cell">
          <h3>Contact us</h3>
          <p>Send a message via our contact form and a member of the team will respond within 3 working days.</p>
          <a class="go" href="/contact">Contact form &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="act-cell">
          <h3>Learn more</h3>
          <p>Read the full detail of our five programme pillars and how each one reaches children.</p>
          <a class="go" href="/programmes">Our programmes &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="act-cell">
          <h3>Our story</h3>
          <p>Understand why the literacy gap in these communities is structural, and how we work to close it.</p>
          <a class="go" href="/about">Our story &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
